    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d554">

                <pb facs="0792" n="696" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg696"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr.
                            Woodford.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-03-23"><hi rendition="#italic">March 23,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President approves your statement to the minister for the colonies, as given
                    in your No. 49. He will await your telegram after your interview with the
                    minister for foreign affairs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
